  "rescue_title": "Every shelved drug is a promise waiting to be kept",
  "rescue_p": "BlackPhage specializes in drug rescue. Too many promising molecules are set aside, not because they fail to work, but because they are too toxic, too blunt or too hard to dose. We believe they deserve a second chance. With NovaDiff we study why a candidate stalled, then redesign it into a sharper Smart Binder that acts where it should and spares the rest. For patients, for the scientists who spent years on these ideas, and for the startups that dare to pick them back up.",
